      },
      "note": [
        "This table contains statistics on water use in industry disaggregated by region and type of water. Industry is defined as companies within section B, C and D (Mining and quarrying, Manufacturing and Electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning supply) in the NACE framework. Type of water denotes source of water, e.g. groundwater, surface water, sea water or water purchased from other water supplier. Note that water use by nuclear power plants is not included in the table. Volumes of used water can differ from volumes of abstracted water. For data on water abstraction, please use the table: Water abstraction in industry by region and type of water.",
        "The statistics refer to water abstraction during the entire year of reference."
